// ==== src/paint/gesture.js
// paint/gesture.js : the arm.  A pure, deterministic model that turns a control path and an intent into stroke samples for the
// brush and the stick to consume.  It models the hand that moves the tool, not the paint.
//
//   PK.gesture(rng, path, opts) -> { pts: [[x, y, pressure, speed, t], ...], length, closed, overshoot, step }
//     path         [[x,y],...] control polyline (open, or closed via opts.closed)
