//     opts.speed   'fast' | 'slow' | number 0..1 (default 0.5): peak speed of the run
//     opts.attack  0..1 how quickly pressure comes on at the start (default 0.3; 0 = full pressure at once)
//     opts.end     'lift' | 'stop' | 'flick' (default 'lift'): lift = pressure falls to 0 over the last part with the path running on a
//                  little; stop = pressure held (pressed in a touch), the path stops dead, a square end; flick = fast lift, long overshoot
//     opts.press   base pressure 0..1 (default 0.7); opts.pressVar per-stroke variation (default 0.15)
//     opts.tremor  hand wobble, rms px at speed 0.5 (default 0.6), scales as 1/speed, low frequency (wavelength 25 to 60 px)
//     opts.smooth  passes of smoothing of the control path before sampling (default 2); corners stay corners when the turn exceeds 60 deg
//     opts.overshoot  px past the end at speed 1 (default 6); scales with the actual end speed; 'flick' runs 2.5x; 'stop' none
//     opts.hand    'nava' (default; loose, fast, lifts) | 'careful' (slow, even, stops) | 'none': a named preset over the numbers
//                  above; an option given explicitly always wins over the preset
