//   (local = peak * (1 - 0.75 * curvature_normalised), floor 0.25 of peak in a tight corner) and falls at the end for 'lift' and
//   'stop'.  Pressure: attack ramp, hold with a slow drift, a little heavier where the arm is slow, then the end rule.  Tremor is a
//   perpendicular displacement from 1D noise along arc length with rms amplitude tremor * (0.5 / local speed).
//   t is time in ticks: one tick is the time to cover one px at speed 1, so dt between samples = step / speed.
//   Every random number comes from rng: the call takes exactly ONE draw from the caller's rng (a fork) and draws the rest from the
