// dry zone), 04_shark 560,640 (waves: the dry end is a few fine hairs, not a comb), 08_menorah_dragon 170,520 (white candles: square torn ends in
// 3-6 flat steps), 05_black_angel_halo 540,180 (black wing: a clean edge with the odd rag, no lit ridge).  docs/swatches/brush_vs_nava*.png.)
