// dragged in several directions with the white ground through it), the red angel's body (975029 500,700: pink over a deeper red, both thin), the
// magenta car (885403 1150,850: a lighter pink under the magenta, drags crossing), a black mass (885422 1280,1280).  docs/swatches/brush_translucency_vs_nava.png.)
//   brushStroke body (under 1): the flat body is a veil, the paint is full-colour bristle streaks kept by a streak field part shared across one
