// ==== src/hand/pack.js
// hand/pack.js : the all-over packing and the ordered element painter (lane K-MURA, 2026-09-05; merged from paintings/M01a (density: the
// distance-field gap fill), M01b (the word interface, frame [x, y, w, h]) and M01c (explicit scale bands, protected large faces, clustered
