//     report: { count, main, fills, byType, bands: [{ asked, placed }], coverage, maxGap, protectedCover, dark, clusters, crowded, cells }
//   PK.hand.packStats.coverage(items, frame, o) / protection(items, o) / clustering(items, rng, o)   the meters (independent of pack's insides)
